### Ping kontrolera
GET http://localhost:8080/webapi/test
Accept: text/plain

###

### Test statusu - 200
GET http://localhost:8080/webapi/test-status?value=ok
Accept: text/plain

###

### Test statusu - 404
GET http://localhost:8080/webapi/test-status?value=fail
Accept: text/plain

###

### Weekly contributions bez filtra
GET http://localhost:8080/webapi/weekly-contributions?apiKey=CDE25C6A-B2C2-C44D-B9AB-1CE85D8E79E8AF439A12-1048-4D7B-A0BA-BB33EC933C09
Accept: application/json

###

### Weekly contributions z filtrem minGold
GET http://localhost:8080/webapi/weekly-contributions-filtered?apiKey=CDE25C6A-B2C2-C44D-B9AB-1CE85D8E79E8AF439A12-1048-4D7B-A0BA-BB33EC933C09&minGold=10
Accept: application/json

### Dodanie notatki - poprawne
POST http://localhost:8080/webapi/notes
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "title": "OK tytuł",
  "content": "Jakaś treść"
}

###

### Dodanie notatki - za krótki tytul (powinno byc 400)
POST http://localhost:8080/webapi/notes
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "title": "A",
  "content": "Za krotki tytuł"
}

###

### Dodanie notatki - brak tytulu (powinno byc 400)
POST http://localhost:8080/webapi/notes
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "content": "Brak tytułu"
}

### Notatka - za krotki tytul (PL)
POST http://localhost:8080/webapi/notes
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Accept-Language: pl

{
  "title": "A",
  "content": "Za krotki tytuł"
}

###

### Notatka - za krotki tytul (IT)
POST http://localhost:8080/webapi/notes
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Accept-Language: it

{
  "title": "A",
  "content": "Titolo troppo corto"
}

### Dodanie notatki - poprawne (PL)
POST http://localhost:8080/webapi/notes
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Accept-Language: pl

{
  "title": "Test",
  "content": "Pierwsza notatka"
}

###

### Dodanie notatki z duplikatem tytułu (PL) - powinno być 400 z komunikatem o duplikacie
POST http://localhost:8080/webapi/notes
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Accept-Language: pl

{
  "title": "Test",
  "content": "Druga notatka z tym samym tytułem"
}


### IllegalArgument test - powinno trafić do @ExceptionHandler
GET http://localhost:8080/webapi/guild-notes?phrase=foo
Accept: text/plain

###

### Dodanie guild note - brak autora (400 z komunikatem walidatora DTO)
POST http://localhost:8080/webapi/guild-notes
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Accept-Language: pl

{
  "title": "Info o raidzie",
  "content": "Zbiórka 20:00",
  "author": ""
}

###

### Dodanie guild note - poprawne (201)
POST http://localhost:8080/webapi/guild-notes
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Accept-Language: pl

{
  "title": "Info o raidzie",
  "content": "Zbiórka 20:00",
  "author": "Korcyk"
}